{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CekhuZGtQp78HHPx8U83X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Here's a summary of the implementation:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the shipment confirmation endpoint (`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`) for the BE-003 requirement. The implementation:\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n1. **Added error code** (ApiError.kt): `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` for when a cancelled shipment is being confirmed\n\n2. **Implemented confirm endpoint** (ShipmentController.kt): \n   - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that:\n     - Returns **404** (ResourceNotFoundException) if shipment doesn't exist\n     - Transitions **CREATED** → **CONFIRMED** and persists the change\n     - Returns **200 OK** unchanged for already **CONFIRMED** shipments (idempotent)\n     - Returns **409 CONFLICT** (ConflictException) for **CANCELLED** shipments\n\n3. **Added comprehensive tests** (ShipmentControllerTest.kt):\n   - ✅ Confirms a created shipment transitions to CONFIRMED\n   - ✅ Confirming already-confirmed shipment succeeds without change (retry-safe)\n   - ✅ Confirming cancelled shipment returns 409 conflict\n   - ✅ Confirming non-existent shipment returns 404 not found\n\n### Acceptance Criteria Met:\n\n- ✅ Build passes with no compilation errors\n- ✅ All 17 tests pass (5 existing + 4 new + 8 from other features)\n- ✅ Endpoint confirms created shipments and persists changes\n- ✅ Error responses use consistent error envelope with proper codes\n- ✅ Idempotent operation (repeated confirm succeeds), cancelled shipment rejected, unknown id rejected\n- ✅ No new Maven dependencies\n- ✅ Only modified shipment feature files + API error codes"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":944,"cache_read_input_tokens":42244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"eph